            gzip -dc jupiq-${{ github.ref_name }}.tar.gz | docker load
            docker image inspect jupiq:${{ github.ref_name }}
            ```
          files: ${{ steps.version.outputs.archive }}
          fail_on_unmatched_files: true
          overwrite_files: true
          generate_release_notes: true

      - name: 원격 Release 단일 자산 강제 및 검증
        shell: bash
